   "why": "Consolidating three duplicate implementations found after a burst of parallel agent work on #1068. No rule changed in substance: cwn_lifestyles now loads its three tables from data/rules/cwn/*.json instead of embedding them; cwn_spells and EffortPool now share cwn_magic.overcast_total; cwn_alienation reads cwn_cyberware.SYNDROMES instead of restating it (and therewith corrects Stressed from +3 to the SRD's +5). Also: cwn_attack_modifiers now loads ATTACK_MODIFIER_TABLE from data/rules/wn_core.json, where it was byte-identical to a second copy. Merging four rule-layer duplicates that #1097 recorded but deferred. No rule changed in substance: cwn_lifestyles loads its three tables from data/rules/cwn/*.json; cwn_spells and EffortPool share cwn_magic.overcast_total(); cwn_alienation reads cwn_cyberware.SYNDROMES (correcting Stressed from +3 to the SRD's +5); cwn_attack_modifiers loads its table from data/rules/wn_core.json.",
